WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:08.560
Fidio yii funni ni ifihan kukuru si ẹrọ Arclight.

2
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.520
Yipada lori lilo bọtini grẹy yii.

3
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:18.440
Ni akọkọ, awọn opin mejeeji ti Arclight le wa ni akoko kanna.

4
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:24.580
Ti ko ba wa ni titan rara tabi awọn ina ti wa ni baibai, batiri naa le jẹ alapin.

5
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.360
So pọ sii nipa lilo ṣaja USB.

6
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:31.240
Nigbati gbigba agbara, awọn ina alawọ ewe yoo wa ni titan.

7
00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:37.510
Lẹhin iṣẹju 15, o yẹ ki o gba agbara ni kikun ati ṣiṣẹ fun awọn wakati pupọ.

8
00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:41.390
Nlọ kuro ni imọlẹ oorun yoo jẹ ki batiri naa gba agbara.

9
00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.970
Iwọ kii yoo nilo lati ropo eyikeyi awọn batiri tabi awọn isusu.

10
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:49.090
Ipo nigbati awọn opin mejeeji ba wa fun lilo gbogbogbo.

11
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:54.980
Yipada si ipo oju nipa didimu bọtini mọlẹ fun awọn aaya 15.

12
00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.920
Lẹhinna gbe awọn ika ọwọ rẹ soke ki o yara tẹ lẹẹkansi bi ina ṣe n tan.

13
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.560
O wa bayi ni ipo oju, nibiti ophthalmoscope yoo wa lori

14
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.940
akọkọ, ki o si awọn iwaju apa loupe.

15
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:13.960
Tunṣe awọn igbesẹ wọnyi yoo yika nipasẹ awọn ọna oriṣiriṣi mẹta ti lilo.

16
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.740
Lilo gbogbogbo, oju, lẹhinna eti.

17
00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:20.080
Ni kete ti o ba ti yan ipo ti o fẹ, tẹ bọtini grẹy

18
00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.520
yi pada bi awọn imọlẹ ti wa ni imọlẹ ati eyi ti opin ti wa ni tan.

19
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:30.140
Rii daju pe o lo ipari ti o tọ fun idanwo to tọ.

20
00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.700
Oju ita ni a ṣe ayẹwo nipasẹ lilo loupe.

21
00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:41.140
Wiwo naa yoo han gbangba nigbati o ba sunmọ oju ni ayika 6 cm.

22
00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:48.300
Iṣatunṣe inawo ni a ṣe ni ipari apa nipa lilo ophthalmoscope taara.

23
00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:53.740
Ti wiwo naa ba ni aifọwọyi, lẹhinna ṣayẹwo agbeko lẹnsi wa ni oke.

24
00:01:54.160 --> 00:02:00.540
Ni ipo yii, ko si lẹnsi ni iho oju ati ifasilẹ yẹ ki o jẹ kedere.

25
00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:50.180
Awọn Arclight tun le ṣee lo lati ya fidio ti awọn ami iwosan

26
00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:53.760
nigbati o ba so mọ kamẹra foonu alagbeka.

27
00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:57.810
Ni kete ti so, iho oju ti ophthalmoscope taara

28
00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:05.920
yoo gbe taara si aarin ti awọn lẹnsi ti kamẹra alagbeka rẹ nlo ni ipo fidio.

29
00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:11.800
Kamẹra naa yoo ṣiṣẹ gẹgẹ bi oju rẹ nigbati o n wa nipasẹ iho oju.

30
00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.720
Lati jẹrisi eyi ti lẹnsi lati laini soke iho oju pẹlu,

31
00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:21.760
ṣii ohun elo fidio lori foonu rẹ, gbe ika rẹ si lẹnsi kọọkan ni titan.

32
00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:27.100
Nigbati iboju ba ṣokunkun, o ti bo lẹnsi ti a lo fun fidio.

33
00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:31.960
Yọ iwe ofeefee kuro lati ẹhin agekuru naa.

34
00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:38.180
Gbe awọn aaye ti itọka si aarin ti lẹnsi ti a lo lati ya fidio.

35
00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.040
Tẹ agekuru naa si isalẹ ṣinṣin.

36
00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:43.150
Yọ itọka naa kuro.

37
00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:47.410
Agekuru yẹ ki o wa ni bayi ni ipo ti o tọ.

38
00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:51.470
Lati fidio ifasilẹ, yipada si oju ophthalmoscope taara

39
00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:56.770
opin Arclight ki o yan ina ti o tan julọ pẹlu awọn jinna mẹta.

40
00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:59.310
Rii daju pe agbeko lẹnsi wa ni oke.

41
00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:03.820
Pẹlu ina ti nkọju si kuro lati foonu si ọna alaisan,

42
00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:09.840
gbe Arclight sinu agekuru naa ki o fa rirọ naa lati ni aabo.

43
00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:14.840
Titari Arclight soke titi ti ko le rọra siwaju.

44
00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.380
Iho oju ti ophthalmoscope taara

45
00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:23.560
yoo wa ni bayi taara lori aarin ti lẹnsi ti o ya fidio.

46
00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:28.460
Lati ṣe igbasilẹ oju ita, lo opin ẹrọ miiran.

47
00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:34.160
Lati ya awọn aworan, ṣii ohun elo fidio ki o sun-un sinu,

48
00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:38.020
àgbáye iboju pẹlu wiwo nipasẹ iho oju.

49
00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:41.000
Tẹ igbasilẹ ki o ṣe idanwo naa.

50
00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:43.220
Tẹ idaduro ati fi fidio pamọ.

51
00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:48.200
O le pin bayi pẹlu awọn ẹlẹgbẹ lori aabo, awọn iru ẹrọ ti paroko

52
00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:53.260
nikan fun idi eyi ti o gba igbanilaaye lati ọdọ alaisan.

53
00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:19.890
Gbadun lilo Arclight ninu iṣẹ rẹ.
